## 19.1 Conversion Rate

A possible definition:

```text
Conversion Rate =
(Number of Converted Leads / Number of Eligible Leads) × 100
```

The business must define whether cancelled, duplicate, or otherwise excluded leads count in the denominator.

Do not silently choose a business definition.

## 19.2 Lead Response Time

A possible definition:

```text
Lead Response Time =
First Contractor Contact Timestamp - Lead Assignment Timestamp
```

Only calculate this when both timestamps exist.

## 19.3 Reporting Rules

- Use database aggregation where appropriate.
- Apply role-based data filtering.
- Avoid loading every lead into frontend memory.
- Support date-range filters.
- Handle empty datasets.
- Clearly distinguish current counts from historical counts.
- Do not invent conversion or response-time data.

